# H700 base OS stock harvest allowlist.
# One device path per line; comments and blanks ignored.
# Directories are captured recursively; symlinks are dereferenced (tar -h),
# so list soname paths (what the dynamic linker/dlopen actually request),
# not the fully-versioned real files.
# AArch64 entries derive from the on-device ldd closure of every NextUI ELF +
# kept daemons (2026-07-19, RG40XXV stock V1.1.1.0); ARMHF compatibility entries
# extend that set per issue #13. See docs/01-rootfs-and-init.md.

## dynamic linker + glibc
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/ld-linux-aarch64.so.1
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libm.so.6
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libdl.so.2
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libpthread.so.0
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/librt.so.1
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libutil.so.1
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libcrypt.so.1
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libresolv.so.2
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libnss_files.so.2
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libnss_dns.so.2
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libgcc_s.so.1
/usr/lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libstdc++.so.6

## GPU: Mali blob + GLES/EGL shims (fbdev winsys)
